<#medication-request-reference-outside> a bridge:IsomorphicConversionTest ;
  mf:name "medication-request-reference-outside" ;
  rdfs:comment "A MedicationRequest whose drug is a Medication outside its document, as an Apple Health export holds one: the reference's display names the drug, no code is written, and a finding says so." ;
